# Repo instructions (mandatory)

Before any implementation, refactor, documentation, or commit work in this repository:

1. **Read** the shared project skill at `.agents/skills/repo-agent-instructions/SKILL.md` (or follow the `repo-agent-instructions` skill if already loaded).
2. **Follow** all three rules in that skill: comment style, post-feature doc checklist, and docs-only-after-user-review.

Do not skip this step even for "small" changes. If the skill and this rule disagree, the skill body wins.

> This skill lives under `.agents/skills/` so Cursor and GitHub Copilot / VS Code both discover it.
